title: "Herdr restart B ports: immediate clear epoch, drain earlier effect grants"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Result
    lg1: Restart
    lg2: Breaks NoResumeAfterClear or NoSessionAfterClear
    lg3: Path to the ClearForgets or NoResumeAfterClear or NoSessionAfterClear bug
    lg4: Repeats forever, so ClearForgets breaks
