  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  class lg4 repeats
  s0: Old session and a queued input
  s1: Seed committed#59; gate holds it
  s2: Restart holds the transition and fence
  s3: Exact close confirmed#59; retire and settle
  s4: Old execution retired#59; exclusion still held
  s5: Exclusion released#59; reply pending
  s6: Owner turn began a launch
  s7: Owner turn installed Pending
  s8: Clear requested#59; epoch update pending
  s9: Clear began: epoch bumped#59; a turn is launching
  s10: Clear discarded the queue#59; a turn is launching
  s11: Owner turn began a launch (after a clear)#59; clear completed before an older startup or grant drained#59; original 1 explicitly dropped, original 2 not yet arrived
  s12: Owner turn installed Pending (after a clear)#59; clear completed before an older startup or grant drained#59; original 1 explicitly dropped, original 2 not yet arrived
  s13: Clear requested#59; epoch may advance while an earlier grant lives
  s14: Exclusion released#59; superseded reply pending#59; clear completed before an older startup or grant drained#59; original 1 explicitly dropped, original 2 not yet arrived
  s15: BeginEffect holds create authority
  s16: Exclusion released#59; superseded reply pending#59; clear completed before an older startup or grant drained#59; original 1 explicitly dropped, original 2 waiting
  s17: A launch resumed the conversation a clear ended#59; clear completed before an older startup or grant drained#59; original 1 explicitly dropped, original 2 waiting
  s18: Create answered#59; first input not submitted (after a clear)#59; clear completed before an older startup or grant drained#59; original 1 explicitly dropped, original 2 explicitly dropped
  s19: Clear ended unconfirmed#59; selector still kept#59; a new session lives#59; clear completed before an older startup or grant drained#59; original 1 explicitly dropped, original 2 explicitly dropped
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s2 --> s3: Close only the captured pane
  s3 --> s4: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s4 --> s5: Disconnect keeping selector, release, wake
  s5 --> s6: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s5 --> s5: Accept an input into the owner queue
  s6 --> s7: Install Pending over the vacant row
  s6 --> s8: User requests clear
  s7 --> s8: User requests clear
  s8 --> s9: Advance epoch and mark clearing, including while old I/O is granted
  s9 --> s10: Clear discards the queue and the launching input
  s10 --> s11: Clear drains earlier grants and tears down their exact session
  s8 --> s8: Observe the create epoch
  s10 --> s12: Clear drains earlier grants and tears down their exact session
  s8 --> s13: Compare live epoch and retain create permission
  s12 --> s14: Clear epoch moved: retire the unsent Pending
  s13 --> s15: Advance epoch and mark clearing, including while old I/O is granted
  s14 --> s16: Accept an input into the owner queue
  s15 --> s15: Reply to the command or Clear discards the queue and the launching input
  s16 --> s17: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s15 --> s10: Complete the previously granted create
  s10 --> s18: Clear drains earlier grants and tears down their exact session
  s18 --> s19: Clear epoch moved: do not submit
  s19 --> s19: Probe adopts the Pending pane
